{'symbol': 'MTB', 'date': '2021-04-28 12:20:00', 'title': 'M&T BANK UNVEILS BUFFALO TECH HUB, DESIGNED TO CREATE OVER 1,000 JOBS, ACCELERATE STARTUP GROWTH AND ATTRACT TALENT TO THE REGION', 'text': 'BUFFALO, N.Y., APRIL 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0M&T BANK TODAY DEBUTED ITS COLLABORATIVE WORKSPACE INSIDE THE TECH HUB AT SENECA ONE, MARKING THE COMPLETION OF CONSTRUCTION AT THE NOW-TRANSFORMED DOWNTOWN BUFFALO LANDMARK, THE TALLEST PRIVATELY-OWNED BUILDING IN THE STATE OUTSIDE OF NEW YORK CITY.'}